Fixes needed in ~/Documents/throttle-status/testLBO.py on the box.

The font directory is "slab", not "slap". Both ImageFont.truetype() calls use
the wrong path, so the script raises OSError on the first one and exits before
touching the display. This is why the splash has never appeared, independently
of the service never being installed.

--- a/testLBO.py
+++ b/testLBO.py
@@
-fnt= ImageFont.truetype('/usr/share/fonts/truetype/roboto/slap/RobotoSlab-Bold.ttf',29)
+fnt= ImageFont.truetype('/usr/share/fonts/truetype/roboto/slab/RobotoSlab-Bold.ttf',29)
@@
-fnt2= ImageFont.truetype('/usr/share/fonts/truetype/roboto/slap/RobotoSlab-Bold.ttf',16)
+fnt2= ImageFont.truetype('/usr/share/fonts/truetype/roboto/slab/RobotoSlab-Bold.ttf',16)

Verified present on the box:
  /usr/share/fonts/truetype/roboto/slab/RobotoSlab-Bold.ttf
